/* Unused */
:: Fishing Pier Plank Slip
<<effects>>
<<silently>><<dancedifficulty 600 1200>><</silently>>

Your line goes taut with a sudden pull, something large has grabbed your line. As you brace, the wet planks beneath your feet betray you and you begin to slip.
<br><br>

<<if $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase is "idle">>
	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Plank Slip Whitney]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase is "bet">>
	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Plank Slip Bet]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Plank Slip Whitney
<<effects>>
Whitney lunges forward and catches you by the arm before you can go over the edge. <<nnpc_His "Whitney">> hand grips your arm firmly before shoving you back upright. "Watch yourself."
<<npcincr Whitney lust 2>><<glust>>
<br><br>

By the time you've steadied yourself, your line has gone slack. Whatever grabbed it is long gone.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Plank Slip Bet
<<effects>>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You manage to catch yourself before you go over</span>, palms scraping the railing. One of Whitney's friends lets out a low whistle. The line has already gone slack.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You tumble off the pier and into the water.</span>
	<br><br>

	Whitney's friends burst out laughing as you go over.
	<br><br>

	<<if $rng gte 80>>
		You manage to keep hold of your rod as you go over.
	<<else>>
		Your rod slips from your hands as you fall, tumbling away into the surf. <<handheldruined>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>
